WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.600
A form that only collects is a lead you lose. They picked a time and pressed send. Nobody answers, so they book with the next contractor who does.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
One submit, three places.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
The same payload writes a row to the Intake tab, posts a formatted embed to Discord, and confirms to the lead — before you open your inbox.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
The visitor hears back in seconds.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
They get the time they picked, their own words, and one clear promise: a reply by email, usually the same day. Single channel or omnichannel — same intake, priced per scope.
